            "body": "> All javascript frameworks related LSPs are raining down on mini.completion and mini.snippets :) . I uploaded a bug for svelte, another for vue and now finally react enters the chat :). And the funny part none of it is related to mini.completion nor mini.snippets.\n\nYeah... If anything, this prompts to take a look if reverting the code addition or a safer approach is reasonable. But as far as I could infer, the reason is indeed the servers not following the spec. And discarding a useful feature because of that (and some internal Vim limitations) is sad.",
