        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "I indeed could not reliably reproduce the issue (only like 1 in 10 times) and thus did not try to investigate the root cause (which I do think is probably due to the server not following the LSP specification).\n\nBut I believe (i.e. hope) that this should now be resolved on latest `main` due to 'mini.completion' being more careful about cleaning up side effects of these `x` characters (which should not happen in the first place).",
